  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Performance: Implemented Zero-Allocation WebSocket Handshake using Span<byte> and stackalloc, eliminating heap allocations for SHA-1/Base64 operations.\n      - Optimization: Added 'Fast-Path' request routing in OnReceivedRequestHeader to process HTTP/API traffic without WebSocket handshake overhead.\n      - Reliability: Fixed cache consistency bug in TryGetHeader/TryGetCookie by implementing a guaranteed scan-and-fill mechanism for O(1) lookup reliability.\n      - Compatibility: Full RFC 6455 compliance for secure, high-throughput WebSocket communication.",
